usage: launch.py [-h] --input INPUT --output OUTPUT [--sage SAGE]
                 [--validate-only]

Capped launcher for an UNEXECUTED Sage research prototype. No worker is run by
importing this module or by requesting --help. Use the existing
execution/admission rules before running a numerical job.

options:
  -h, --help       show this help message and exit
  --input INPUT
  --output OUTPUT
  --sage SAGE
  --validate-only
